{"type":"text","timestamp":1791837623787,"sessionID":"ses_ece27ce8fffe6s2p0ePjjd3OcA","part":{"id":"prt_131d8463e001VcUoKhYgroLzQT","sessionID":"ses_ece27ce8fffe6s2p0ePjjd3OcA","messageID":"msg_131d8422a001PHoMl4CD4sHRQn","type":"text","text":"Now I have everything I need. Let me analyze the source request and produce the complete Requirements Elicitation Package.\n\n**Source request analysis:**\n\n> *When a client submits a valid order, the order service shall assign an order identifier and return it in the submission response. A valid order contains at least one product identifier and a positive quantity for each product.*\n\nThe source joins two obligations with \"and\" (assign + return), contains a validity definition, and leaves several material facts unresolved (identifier format/uniqueness, what happens when the order is invalid, idempotency, etc.). I'll now draft the full package.","time":{"start":1791837619774,"end":1791837623787}}}
